    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit and Stand Blackjack</strong> is a relaxed 2D card game where you play classic blackjack at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers, no pressure \u2014 just sit back, play your hand, and enjoy the calm atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only sound in the game is a gentle <strong>background music track</strong>, designed to help you relax. Prefer silence? You can easily adjust or disable the music in the settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic solo blackjack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over/Under side bet: Guess if your starting hand totals over or under 13 for bonus credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split pairs for more chances to win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels \u2014 from casual to challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unlockable achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing background music only</strong> (no sound effects)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple included backgrounds to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable audio and language settings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're unwinding after a long day or looking for a chill card game, <i>Hit and Stand Blackjack</i> is your perfect match.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit and Stand Blackjack</strong> is a relaxed 2D card game where you play classic blackjack at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers, no pressure \u2014 just sit back, play your hand, and enjoy the calm atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only sound in the game is a gentle <strong>background music track</strong>, designed to help you relax. Prefer silence? You can easily adjust or disable the music in the settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic solo blackjack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over/Under side bet: Guess if your starting hand totals over or under 13 for bonus credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split pairs for more chances to win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels \u2014 from casual to challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unlockable achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing background music only</strong> (no sound effects)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple included backgrounds to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable audio and language settings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're unwinding after a long day or looking for a chill card game, <i>Hit and Stand Blackjack</i> is your perfect match.</p>",
